# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Quill — Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values. Never commit .env.local.
# Check what is actually configured at any time with GET /api/health — it
# reports which variables are missing without exposing any value.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Supabase (public / client-side) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Project URL — safe to expose in the browser.
# Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > API > Project URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co

# Anonymous key — safe to expose; every table is protected by RLS.
# Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > API > anon key
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# ── Supabase (server-side) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Service role key — bypasses Row Level Security. Server-only, never in the
# browser bundle. Required for: Inngest jobs, RAG retrieval, the audit log, and
# admin role changes.
# Supabase Dashboard > Project Settings > API > service_role key
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

# ── Anthropic ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Drafting, QA, and SEO passes on Claude models.
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ── OpenAI (optional — the app runs degraded without it) ─────────────────────
# Embeddings are OpenAI-only, so this key gates document search (RAG) and
# document ingestion. Without it, Claude still drafts articles from the brand
# profile, the GPT model options are hidden, and the UI says so explicitly.
# Uses text-embedding-3-large at 1536 dimensions, matching
# app.document_chunks.embedding halfvec(1536).
# https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# ── Inngest ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Event key — lets the app enqueue generation and ingestion jobs.
# https://app.inngest.com > your app > Manage > Event Keys
INNGEST_EVENT_KEY=...

# Signing key — lets Inngest call back into /api/inngest.
# https://app.inngest.com > your app > Manage > Signing Keys
INNGEST_SIGNING_KEY=signkey-...

# ── Local development without Inngest cloud ──────────────────────────────────
# Run `npx inngest-cli@latest dev` in another terminal and set this to use the
# local Inngest dev server instead of the cloud keys above.
# INNGEST_DEV=1

# ── App (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Canonical public URL. Optional: the app derives its origin from the request
# headers, which is correct on localhost, Vercel previews, and production alike.
# Set it only if you need to force a specific origin.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://quill.example.com
